From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:40:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the Microsoft Surface Laptop
 13-inch

The Surface Laptop 13-inch 1st Edition is a laptop on the Snapdragon X
Plus X1P-42-100 (Purwa), built on the Surface Pro 12-inch's board. Add
its compatible to the X1P42100 boards.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index d8921d9..14b46e1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -1252,6 +1252,10 @@ properties:
           - const: microsoft,denali
           - const: qcom,x1e80100
 
+      - items:
+          - const: microsoft,surface-laptop-13
+          - const: qcom,x1p42100
+
       - items:
           - const: microsoft,surface-pro-12in
           - const: qcom,x1p42100
-- 
2.47.3

